# .vercelignore — keep internal & sensitive files OUT of the public deploy.
#
# Vercel deploys the WORKING TREE, not git — so .gitignore gives ZERO edge
# protection and every non-excluded file is served at https://mythsensus.com.
# Added 2026-06-10 after an audit found live credentials served at HTTP 200
# (_credentials.local.md, _qa-out/gumroad-create-9.cjs).
#
# RULE: anchored (leading /) or full-path patterns ONLY. A bare "*.md" would
# match RECURSIVELY and delete Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/oracle/**/*.md,
# which api/oracle/addon.js reads at runtime (process.cwd()) — breaking the
# paid Oracle Deep Reading. Never add an unanchored glob here.

# ── Live credentials / tokens (the P0) ──
/_credentials.local.md
/_qa-out/

# ── Internal docs: architecture, strategy, handoffs ──
/CLAUDE.md
/README.md
/COMPETITOR-RESEARCH.md
/mythsensus-cowork-brief.md
/HANDOFF-2026-04-27.md
/HANDOFF-2026-05-02.md
/HANDOFF-2026-05-02-v2.md
/HANDOFF-2026-05-04.md
/Mythsensus_ClaudeCode_Handoff.docx
/Mythsensus_Master_Brief.docx
/_n8n_oracle_deep_reading_DEPLOY_GUIDE.md
/_oracle_cache_test.json
/migrations/
/Sample for acceptable template/

# ── Other internal / underscore-prefixed dirs ──
/_legacy/
/_mockups/
/_launch-drafts/
/_audit-screens-2026-06-04/

# ── QA / simulator / audit artifacts (regenerated on demand) ──
/qa-report.html
/qa-screenshots/
/user-sim-report.html
/user-sim-screenshots/
/audit-bilingual-report.json
/audit-bilingual-screenshots/
/visual-qa-report.json
/visual-qa-screenshots/

# ── Engine SOURCE + heavy nested build/test tree ──
# The browser loads the COMPILED bundle from ROOT /build/ only. api/oracle/addon.js
# reads .md prompts from Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/oracle/** — those MUST stay,
# so only the source .ts + heavy subdirs are excluded, never the oracle/ path.
/Mythsensus/Mythsensus/
/Mythsensus/build/
/Mythsensus/tests/
/Mythsensus/html-mockups/
/Mythsensus/test-artifacts/
/Mythsensus/brief/
/Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/calc.ts
/Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/report.ts
/Mythsensus/report-engine/lib/report.ts.mojibake.bak

# ── Data backups + seeds (only data/gods.json + data/sacred-places.json ship) ──
/data/gods.json.pre-epic.bak
/data/gods.json.pre-legendary.bak
/data/gods.json.pre-mythic.bak
/data/gods.json.pre-tags.bak
/data/_pilgrimage_seed/

# ── Build deps (Vercel reinstalls from package.json) + CI config ──
/node_modules/
/.github/
